  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed felling of the front garden London Plane tree subject to Tree Preservation Order TPO/455/07/26 would cause harm with regard to amenity and would be detrimental to the character and appearance of The Mall Conservation Area. Furthermore, the applicant has failed to demonstrate through a structural report that there would be sufficient justification to allow the felling of this visually important tree. For this reason, the proposal is contrary to Policies OS5 and DC8 of the Local Plan (2018) and Key Principle CAG6 of the Planning Guidance SPD (2018) and the Climate Change SPD."
